Hello friends, the new SHAPESHOOTER update - Ver. 1.01 is now available!

Here's what changed:
Changed the artstile on the Planet selection menu to fit more the game artstyle;
Checkpoints reviewed and new added in every stage;
AI improved for the circle enemies;
Improved the turret control to work better with analog controller, (it was limited to 8 directions, and now it's completely free);
Added a slider to change the turret rotation speed;
Mouse now are locked inside the game screen;
New mouse recticle;
Improved the navigation through the menus and prompt shown;
Stage selection screen info and Player's gears position;
Game time counter only works during the gameplay;
Little bug are not shown after the endgame;

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143900/Shapeshooter/

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36142644/b30bfedd3982f40f6be2a6046c512e8fe35783e4.gif

If you played the game and enjoyed, please leave a brief steam review, it helps a lot for a small developer.

As always, thank you very much for all of the support. 

Paulo Brunassi

